  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chawanmushi"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is more egg custard than omelette. The"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dashi"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to egg ratio is high, giving a barely-set texture that wobbles gently when the cup is moved. Low, steady heat is everything here."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The most common mistake is steaming at too high a temperature. This causes the egg to bubble and leaves the surface pitted instead of smooth. Use the lowest steam setting or place a folded tea towel under the steamer lid to let some steam escape. Consistent gentle heat is the only way to get a silky result."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "eggs",
              "amount": 4,
              "unit": null,
              "prepNote": "large",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "dashi-stock",
              "amount": 500,
              "unit": "ml",
              "prepNote": "cooled to room temperature",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "soy-sauce-light",
              "amount": 15,
              "unit": "ml",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "mirin",
              "amount": 10,
              "unit": "ml",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "sake",
              "amount": 10,
              "unit": "ml",
              "prepNote": null,
